# N+1

## Phat hien

- Bat spring.jpa.show-sql: true (profile local) de quan sat query.
- Test voi data lon (>1000 records).

## Giai phap

- @EntityGraph(attributePaths = {...}).
- JOIN FETCH trong JPQL.
- Projection (interface-based DTO).
- @BatchSize(size = 50) hoac hibernate.batch_size: 50 (da cau hinh).
- 2 queries thay vi 1 join phuc tap (khi collection lon).

## Quy tac

- **Khong dung** EAGER bua bai de che N+1.
- Moi list API co quan he (Order -> Items, Product -> Variants, Cart -> Items) **phai** test khong N+1 truoc khi merge.
